STAGE (v14, INFRA 2026-10-25: 20 waiters / 700 GB queued on epyc1 while epyc2/3 + intel1/2 admitted ~2 TB: their kits
were 10 MB each, but SPILL copies whole LANE roots and every lane script that names the shared worktree lane (claude/wt,
